Package: AreasOfOpportunity
Title: Filter and Map UK Geographic Areas
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Paul", "Heselwood", , "paul.heselwood@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A foundation for working with UK geographic areas. Lists and
    filters areas at Output Area, LSOA, Ward, Local Authority District,
    County, Community Safety Partnership and Police Force Area level (via
    the ONS Open Geography Portal), and fetches area boundaries for
    mapping. Intended as a base layer for other area-level data (e.g.
    crime, deprivation) to be joined on top of.
